# Used vs unused finished videos

Finished production-library MP4s live in two folders. Do not mix them.

```
downloads/production_library/unused/<video_key>/final.mp4
downloads/production_library/used/<video_key>/final.mp4
```

## When

- New register / import copies the final into **unused**.
- Website **Mark used** (posting status) moves that folder to **used**.
- Unmark all platforms moves it back to **unused**.
- Job outputs under `downloads/motivational/.../output/` stay put. Library copy is the one that moves.

## Do

- After marking used, confirm `final_output_path` contains `/used/`.
- Filter Library / Videos by Unused vs Used instead of hunting mixed folders.
- Keep components next to the final when the library folder moves.

```
# ❌ BAD — dump posted and unposted finals in one folder
downloads/production_library/video_000047/final.mp4

# ✅ GOOD — posted file in used, still-to-post in unused
downloads/production_library/unused/video_000047/final.mp4
downloads/production_library/used/video_000048/final.mp4
```
